n Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"FSvFk1lWR0YBYP_-L_iLTQ","review_id":"5EfRXHgO-hvBVpi9UpTutg","date":"2018-08-23T10:34:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9317663311958313,"text_excerpt":"They have some of the best coffee in the city, in my opinion. And I like the ambience a lot especially if I need to go somewhere and study and drink coffee for a bit. The large ceilings and classical music and the overall sound seems to just get me focused on the books for a bit. The location is nice too off carrollton and makes studying for a bit not so boring. If I were to find a negative, it's that their pastries and food are usually dry and not that great. Otherwise, I'll keep coming back and will recommend the place to others."},{"business_id":"FSvFk1lWR0YBYP_-L_iLTQ","review_id":"6V0Igx07xHpA9mGZX6qZGQ","date":"2018-11-20T19:18:01","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9307057857513428,"text_excerpt":"We stopped in here late on a week night when our friends were visiting in town. It was hard to find a place for coffee and to hang out that also stayed open late. Fortunately, this place does! They are located in an old building with a high ceiling and really cool architecture. They play very relaxing classical music that fit the mood just right. They have plenty of tables on the main floor and it looked like a smaller selection upstairs. There was a good size amount of people there on their laptops. We were able to get a table for the 4 of us without any problem. My iced latte was fantastic. It was probably the best I've had in a long time. I had some leftover and it was even good the ne..."},{"business_id":"FSvFk1lWR0YBYP_-L_iLTQ","review_id":"dZbpMtI5J6zCkvvHiIwqYg","date":"2015-07-26T01:06:40","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9286953210830688,"text_excerpt":"I like this coffee shop quite a bit. It is in a very cool building and a nice place to hang out for a couple of hours. The coffee is strong and consistently good. Employees are on the hipster side of the spectrum but pleasant enough. I found myself going out of my way a couple of time on my recent trip to NOLA to go to this coffee shop vs the CCs on Magazine & Jefferson. Like the atmosphere of Rue De La Course much better and the coffee is better as well."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"FSvFk1lWR0YBYP_-L_iLTQ","photo_id":"q-E54Y6jRFjFHHtO8uR31g","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/q-E54Y6jRFjFHHtO8uR31g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9171774387359619},{"business_id":"FSvFk1lWR0YBYP_-L_iLTQ","photo_id":"dbbL2nCVouoElhxuw3GsJA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dbbL2nCVouoElhxuw3GsJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8679959177970886},{"business_id":"FSvFk1lWR0YBYP_-L_iLTQ","photo_id":"sX3QpMkuGopiJ5rO_3Hamw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/sX3QpMkuGopiJ5rO_3Hamw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8253734707832336},{"business_id":"FSvFk1lWR0YBYP_-L_iLTQ","photo_id":"ASnXXQpg5lhDEpuv7KuLjg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ASnXXQpg5lhDEpuv7KuLjg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7900896072387695},{"business_id":"FSvFk1lWR0YBYP_-L_iLTQ","photo_id":"8pI3wU413jTRm-O09724HA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/8pI3wU413jTRm-O09724HA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7849368453025818}]},"notebook_case":null}
